    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this First-person horror puzzle game you play as May who has broken into a museum, that is currently being built, to steal what ever she can find. She accidentally drops an ancient artifact and is hit in the face with dust. She is now noticing a monster roaming around the museum and has to hide while solving escape room puzzles to get out. Is the monster in her head or did she release an ancient evil? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like horror but want to solve the puzzles? We got you covered with visitor mode where you play as a visitor at the museum walking around looking and learning while solving the puzzles without the monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This First-person horror puzzle game uses a combination of physics based puzzles and point and click.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this First-person horror puzzle game you play as May who has broken into a museum, that is currently being built, to steal what ever she can find. She accidentally drops an ancient artifact and is hit in the face with dust. She is now noticing a monster roaming around the museum and has to hide while solving escape room puzzles to get out. Is the monster in her head or did she release an ancient evil? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like horror but want to solve the puzzles? We got you covered with visitor mode where you play as a visitor at the museum walking around looking and learning while solving the puzzles without the monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This First-person horror puzzle game uses a combination of physics based puzzles and point and click.\u00a0</p>",
